      "Do not create duplicate routes or duplicate navigation items.",
      "If /about-us already exists, inspect and improve that route.",
      "Add About Us to the existing navigation only if it is missing.",
      "Keep the site's real logo, navigation destinations, quote CTA\nand shared styles wherever possible.",
      "Do not remove, rename or break working features.",
      "Do not install a new animation framework when GSAP is already\ninstalled and suitable."
